{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_unleashed_actors(npc.UUID) %}
A nearby unleashed person stops {{speakingNpc.name}} from putting a leash on them. Use only when that person is able to prevent the collar — they can block, overpower, or otherwise stop it — not when they merely object or dislike it. Does not put a leash on anyone.
Available targets: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Never pick anyone not listed.
